WEBVTT

00:01:33.560 --> 00:01:36.610
Onii-chan, Onii-chan.

00:01:38.110 --> 00:01:40.310
Are you still sleeping?

00:01:45.730 --> 00:01:47.930
Elis, it's summer vacation.

00:01:47.930 --> 00:01:50.390
Let me sleep a little longer.

00:01:51.410 --> 00:01:53.250
Do you understand how I feel now...

00:01:53.250 --> 00:01:55.560
being forced to wake up all the time?

00:01:56.130 --> 00:02:00.100
I was up late studying.

00:02:01.320 --> 00:02:04.030
You promised we'd go yukata
shopping together.

00:02:04.380 --> 00:02:06.330
Is that right?

00:02:06.760 --> 00:02:07.640
Hey.

00:02:07.640 --> 00:02:11.310
Why don't you paint during
summer vacation?

00:02:12.740 --> 00:02:14.910
I'll be your model.

00:02:15.280 --> 00:02:18.840
I told you I'm not painting any more.

00:02:18.840 --> 00:02:21.810
Besides, I'm no good at life drawing.

00:02:21.810 --> 00:02:22.820
Fine.

00:02:22.820 --> 00:02:23.860
You're no fun.

00:02:28.740 --> 00:02:33.100
I found a great place where
we can watch fireworks.

00:02:33.480 --> 00:02:39.470
No one knows about it, but I'm
willing to take you there.

00:02:39.740 --> 00:02:41.030
Hurry!

00:03:01.830 --> 00:03:05.690
Damn it!

00:03:03.190 --> 00:03:08.170
Midnight Blue Melancholy

00:03:16.430 --> 00:03:18.380
You're yawning again!

00:03:19.660 --> 00:03:23.200
It's rude to yawn in front of girls.

00:03:23.200 --> 00:03:28.370
If you do it again, it'll be your turn
to cook for the next month!

00:03:29.370 --> 00:03:32.070
I'm already making most
of the meals anyway.

00:03:39.080 --> 00:03:41.720
What color yukata do you
think I should get?

00:03:42.200 --> 00:03:43.100
Huh?

00:03:43.300 --> 00:03:46.400
I want something cute, like pink.

00:03:47.540 --> 00:03:49.810
What should I do?

00:03:49.810 --> 00:03:53.530
Wear a more mature color.

00:03:56.910 --> 00:03:58.530
Onii-chan?

00:04:05.520 --> 00:04:07.890
Kiri-san...

00:04:26.540 --> 00:04:27.710
Hey.

00:04:29.190 --> 00:04:30.440
Good morning.

00:04:30.880 --> 00:04:33.550
Are you going tonight?

00:04:33.960 --> 00:04:35.590
Uh, right.

00:04:35.590 --> 00:04:37.700
I don't know.

00:04:40.260 --> 00:04:42.590
Maybe we could go together.

00:04:46.830 --> 00:04:51.630
Come one, come all! We've
got summer sales!

00:04:53.330 --> 00:04:54.670
What a pleasant surprise.

00:04:54.670 --> 00:04:56.770
All my main characters in one place!

00:04:56.950 --> 00:04:58.610
Good morning.

00:04:58.610 --> 00:05:00.320
Good morning, Elis-chan.

00:05:00.320 --> 00:05:01.080
Good morning.

00:05:01.520 --> 00:05:03.520
What are you all doing here?

00:05:03.520 --> 00:05:08.640
Hosen-san, did you come to buy
a yukata for the festival too?

00:05:09.780 --> 00:05:13.210
We actually just ran into
each other over there...

00:05:13.210 --> 00:05:17.720
but we're all on our way to buy yukatas.

00:05:17.720 --> 00:05:20.060
We might as well all go together.

00:05:20.630 --> 00:05:22.600
Kikyo-sensei, you too?

00:05:22.910 --> 00:05:23.770
Huh?

00:05:24.040 --> 00:05:25.960
Uh, yeah...

00:05:25.960 --> 00:05:28.400
Huh? Uh...

00:05:28.400 --> 00:05:29.440
Sensei!

00:05:29.790 --> 00:05:34.220
Sensei, will you choose
my yukata for me?

00:05:34.220 --> 00:05:35.240
What?

00:05:35.240 --> 00:05:37.840
Onii-chan, mine first!

00:05:39.880 --> 00:05:41.120
Sorry!

00:05:41.120 --> 00:05:45.060
I don't know the first thing
about women's yukata.

00:05:45.060 --> 00:05:46.320
Kiri, this one's up to you.

00:05:46.320 --> 00:05:47.260
What?

00:05:48.360 --> 00:05:50.110
See you later.

00:05:50.110 --> 00:05:52.240
Onii-chan!

00:05:52.900 --> 00:05:56.070
Onii-chan!

00:05:57.030 --> 00:05:59.640
But you promised!

00:06:00.930 --> 00:06:04.610
Thanks to you, we all have
fabulous yukatas.

00:06:04.610 --> 00:06:06.580
Thank you.

00:06:07.850 --> 00:06:09.020
I'm glad you like them.

00:06:12.820 --> 00:06:16.680
How do you wear a yukata?

00:06:17.840 --> 00:06:18.690
What?

00:06:19.330 --> 00:06:20.780
What?

00:06:24.640 --> 00:06:26.090
Amazing.

00:06:26.090 --> 00:06:28.870
You can do this too, Kiri-sensei?

00:06:28.870 --> 00:06:30.850
Amazing.

00:06:30.850 --> 00:06:35.080
Not only that, but you are great
at sports and a fabulous cook.

00:06:35.080 --> 00:06:38.280
Sensei, do you have a boyfriend?

00:06:39.070 --> 00:06:40.730
No, I don't.

00:06:41.160 --> 00:06:43.020
What? Really?

00:06:43.020 --> 00:06:44.250
Really.

00:06:44.530 --> 00:06:48.660
I just became a teacher. I don't have
time for that sort of thing.

00:06:48.660 --> 00:06:49.720
That's no fun.

00:06:51.700 --> 00:06:54.990
But is there anyone you
are interested in?

00:06:56.220 --> 00:06:58.710
Elis-chan, I can't breathe...

00:07:00.130 --> 00:07:01.370
Sorry!

00:07:04.680 --> 00:07:06.940
I'm so sorry.

00:07:07.550 --> 00:07:09.880
You squeezed as tightly as
you could, didn't you?

00:07:11.440 --> 00:07:12.880
Are you all right?

00:07:13.510 --> 00:07:14.730
Elis-chan...

00:07:15.180 --> 00:07:17.070
That's a little...

00:07:22.570 --> 00:07:24.190
My, my.

00:07:24.190 --> 00:07:27.360
Your yukata looks like it will
fall off before the festival.

00:07:27.360 --> 00:07:30.030
You should have Sensei
help you put it on.

00:07:30.300 --> 00:07:33.290
Elis-chan, come with me.

00:07:33.290 --> 00:07:34.680
It's fine.

00:07:34.680 --> 00:07:36.470
Just come.

00:07:37.160 --> 00:07:40.600
Go ahead and eat the cakes
we bought earlier.

00:07:40.600 --> 00:07:42.010
Okay.

00:07:42.010 --> 00:07:43.460
You really don't need to do this.

00:07:43.460 --> 00:07:45.540
We'll be in here.

00:07:47.210 --> 00:07:50.150
Could I get some of that cake?

00:07:50.650 --> 00:07:52.880
I could eat three of these.

00:07:55.420 --> 00:07:59.530
Elis-chan, you picked quite
a mature color.

00:07:59.530 --> 00:08:01.400
What a beautiful blue.

00:08:01.400 --> 00:08:03.300
It's midnight blue.

00:08:03.300 --> 00:08:04.820
It really suits you.

00:08:04.820 --> 00:08:07.600
Well, I'm an adult.

00:08:08.950 --> 00:08:10.310
You're right.

00:08:11.520 --> 00:08:13.620
That should do it.

00:08:15.400 --> 00:08:18.770
Kiri-san, how come you
can do so many things?

00:08:19.310 --> 00:08:22.450
I can't cook well.

00:08:22.450 --> 00:08:24.850
I can't even put on a yukata properly.

00:08:27.360 --> 00:08:30.790
I became interested in cooking when
I was in elementary school.

00:08:31.130 --> 00:08:37.950
A boy in my class told me the miso soup I
made in cooking class tasted delicious...

00:08:38.350 --> 00:08:40.800
I learned how to put on
a yukata in high school.

00:08:40.800 --> 00:08:44.240
I promised to go to a festival
with a boy in my class.

00:08:44.760 --> 00:08:47.570
I was determined to go in
a yukata, so I practiced.

00:08:59.400 --> 00:09:00.850
Sensei.

00:09:02.590 --> 00:09:03.780
What is it?

00:09:03.780 --> 00:09:06.860
Would you like mille-feuille
or rare cheese cake?

00:09:07.840 --> 00:09:09.770
Cheese cake, I guess.

00:09:09.770 --> 00:09:11.360
Understood.

00:09:12.100 --> 00:09:14.230
She says she wants cheese cake.

00:09:15.870 --> 00:09:19.200
I've got the perfect ribbon
for that yukata.

00:09:19.730 --> 00:09:21.420
Hold on.

00:09:21.420 --> 00:09:23.260
It's fine.

00:09:24.550 --> 00:09:28.470
Let's see. Where did I put it?

00:09:28.910 --> 00:09:30.690
It's not here...

00:09:30.690 --> 00:09:32.480
Is this... Oh?

00:09:32.480 --> 00:09:34.490
Where is that ribbon?

00:09:35.290 --> 00:09:36.290
I found it.

00:10:04.800 --> 00:10:09.030
Hiroki painted this in high school...

00:10:12.380 --> 00:10:15.960
Onii-chan drew Kiri-san.

00:10:47.590 --> 00:10:49.870
Look, they're selling balloons.

00:10:50.800 --> 00:10:51.750
Yeah.

00:10:52.320 --> 00:10:55.420
Look, those two are matching.

00:10:55.420 --> 00:10:56.070
Yeah.

00:10:56.070 --> 00:11:00.000
Oh, caricatures. Onii-chan,
you should draw some too.

00:11:00.380 --> 00:11:03.260
I told you I'm not good at life drawing.

00:11:03.890 --> 00:11:06.350
You say you aren't any good,
but you do it anyway.

00:11:07.930 --> 00:11:09.380
I saw it.

00:11:10.410 --> 00:11:12.020
At Kiri-san's house.

00:11:12.850 --> 00:11:16.000
The portrait of Kiri-san in high school.

00:11:16.000 --> 00:11:17.760
It was a great drawing.

00:11:18.400 --> 00:11:19.460
Kiri showed you?

00:11:23.410 --> 00:11:25.930
I'll go get my fortune.

00:11:32.390 --> 00:11:35.560
Sorry I'm late, Kimikage-san.

00:11:35.560 --> 00:11:36.740
Ruriko-san.

00:11:37.430 --> 00:11:39.290
You must have been busy.

00:11:39.290 --> 00:11:44.890
Yes, but I love festivals,
so it doesn't bother me.

00:11:45.680 --> 00:11:46.550
I suppose you're right.

00:11:48.780 --> 00:11:50.170
Elis-chan.

00:11:51.750 --> 00:11:52.930
Kiri-san.

00:11:54.000 --> 00:11:55.240
You look beautiful.

00:11:55.240 --> 00:11:56.710
Thank you.

00:11:56.710 --> 00:11:58.880
What's wrong? Are you alone?

00:11:59.210 --> 00:12:00.230
Yes...

00:12:00.230 --> 00:12:01.130
I see...

00:12:04.470 --> 00:12:06.840
He turned me down.

00:12:06.840 --> 00:12:10.030
I finally got up the courage
to tell him, but he said no.

00:12:28.430 --> 00:12:30.020
That looks good on you.

00:12:31.270 --> 00:12:32.330
Kiri-san...

00:12:32.330 --> 00:12:33.000
What?

00:12:33.240 --> 00:12:35.430
Would you like to get your fortune?

00:12:36.180 --> 00:12:37.600
Here you are.

00:12:37.600 --> 00:12:38.730
Here you are.

00:12:39.060 --> 00:12:40.470
Thank you.

00:12:47.960 --> 00:12:51.740
I haven't had Ramune in forever.
It brings back memories.

00:12:51.740 --> 00:12:56.420
Was the festival you went
to in high school like this?

00:12:56.800 --> 00:12:58.360
I don't remember...

00:12:58.790 --> 00:13:01.060
Did you drink Ramune then, too?

00:13:14.340 --> 00:13:16.240
Did you drink Ramune?

00:13:16.600 --> 00:13:18.180
With Onii-chan?

00:13:23.340 --> 00:13:26.180
I don't know. I forgot.

00:13:26.490 --> 00:13:27.120
You're lying!

00:13:27.460 --> 00:13:28.790
There's no way you would forget!

00:13:30.790 --> 00:13:34.260
You would never forget the time you
spent with the man you love!

00:13:34.260 --> 00:13:35.960
I certainly wouldn't!

00:13:35.960 --> 00:13:39.070
Hold on, Elis-chan. I'm not
in love with anyone.

00:13:39.070 --> 00:13:41.770
You loved Onii-chan, didn't you?

00:13:42.150 --> 00:13:46.310
Isn't he the one you confessed your
feelings to in high school?

00:13:47.250 --> 00:13:48.970
Hiroki's just a childhood friend.

00:13:49.970 --> 00:13:52.220
And that's all ancient history.

00:13:52.550 --> 00:13:55.430
I don't think it has anything
to do with you, Elis-chan.

00:13:56.190 --> 00:13:57.560
It does!

00:13:58.550 --> 00:14:00.520
I know!

00:14:00.970 --> 00:14:05.220
Onii-chan told me there are
men better suited for you.

00:14:08.500 --> 00:14:11.840
Onii-chan has feelings for...

00:14:11.840 --> 00:14:12.930
Elis-chan!

00:14:21.990 --> 00:14:24.340
Hey, Elis!

00:14:24.340 --> 00:14:25.080
Elis!

00:14:25.440 --> 00:14:27.200
Where did she go?

00:14:29.310 --> 00:14:31.280
I've been looking all over for you.

00:14:36.430 --> 00:14:37.490
Hey.

00:14:39.890 --> 00:14:41.260
Yukata, huh?

00:14:41.680 --> 00:14:42.590
Yeah...

00:14:46.590 --> 00:14:48.100
Elis-chan...

00:14:52.940 --> 00:14:54.980
I got it!

00:14:55.530 --> 00:14:58.380
All right! I got a Mundam!

00:14:58.780 --> 00:15:01.830
I've got this. I've got it this time...

00:15:01.830 --> 00:15:03.150
I've definitely got this...

00:15:05.950 --> 00:15:06.550
Huh?

00:15:06.810 --> 00:15:08.250
That's not what I...

00:15:08.420 --> 00:15:11.430
Here's your 6 million yen.

00:15:11.430 --> 00:15:12.820
Thank you.

00:15:22.240 --> 00:15:23.710
Elis-chan...

00:15:24.670 --> 00:15:26.470
Is Kamikura-sensei here?

00:15:26.930 --> 00:15:27.970
Yeah...

00:15:30.540 --> 00:15:31.490
Here.

00:15:35.920 --> 00:15:37.350
It's delicious.

00:15:37.800 --> 00:15:40.110
Eat sweets when you're feeling down.

00:15:41.390 --> 00:15:42.290
Let's go.

00:15:42.290 --> 00:15:43.860
Come on.

00:15:45.500 --> 00:15:46.990
Hagino-senpai!

00:15:53.640 --> 00:15:54.880
What is that?

00:15:56.280 --> 00:15:57.710
What's going on?

00:15:57.710 --> 00:16:00.740
Looks like a serious battle.

00:16:08.840 --> 00:16:10.150
Very well...

00:16:20.550 --> 00:16:21.440
Amazing!

00:16:21.440 --> 00:16:22.260
Impressive!

00:16:22.260 --> 00:16:23.130
That's her seventh!

00:16:23.970 --> 00:16:27.060
Where on earth did Elis go?

00:16:34.790 --> 00:16:36.460
Let's try looking over there.

00:16:37.760 --> 00:16:38.690
Okay.

00:16:44.150 --> 00:16:47.520
Want to give it a try, miss?

00:16:47.770 --> 00:16:49.720
Scoop whichever one you like!

00:16:50.300 --> 00:16:53.040
Oh, she's with everyone else.

00:16:53.040 --> 00:16:54.590
I'm relieved.

00:16:54.590 --> 00:16:57.220
Kids should hang out with kids.

00:16:57.220 --> 00:16:58.400
What is that?

00:16:58.400 --> 00:17:01.940
There's somewhere I'd like to go...

00:17:11.860 --> 00:17:14.480
All right, it's my turn.

00:17:15.960 --> 00:17:18.260
Sorry, I'm going to go.

00:17:18.260 --> 00:17:19.950
What's wrong, Elis-chan?

00:17:22.060 --> 00:17:24.100
Did something happen?

00:17:25.830 --> 00:17:27.820
Could a storm be brewing?

00:17:42.340 --> 00:17:43.370
Who's there?

00:17:46.770 --> 00:17:48.110
Hashizume-kun?

00:17:48.820 --> 00:17:49.780
Hosen...

00:17:51.130 --> 00:17:54.260
You surprised me! I was so scared!

00:17:54.260 --> 00:17:57.650
Sorry. I was just taking a shortcut.

00:17:57.650 --> 00:17:58.690
What?

00:18:00.590 --> 00:18:04.390
You knew about that place too, Hosen?

00:18:04.390 --> 00:18:07.230
The view of the fireworks
is great up there.

00:18:07.230 --> 00:18:08.700
Are you here by yourself?

00:18:09.040 --> 00:18:10.700
What's wrong with that?

00:18:10.700 --> 00:18:12.900
I'd watch fireworks by myself.

00:18:13.200 --> 00:18:15.580
There's nothing wrong with it, but...

00:18:18.550 --> 00:18:22.360
I came here when I was a little kid.

00:18:22.360 --> 00:18:25.780
I had forgotten about it, but I suddenly
remembered just a minute ago...

00:18:26.360 --> 00:18:28.260
I thought I'd check it out.

00:18:28.900 --> 00:18:29.930
I see.

00:18:29.930 --> 00:18:33.960
It's a little steep, but this a shortcut.

00:18:33.960 --> 00:18:34.730
Yeah.

00:18:37.050 --> 00:18:41.740
Listen, sorry about what
I said the other day.

00:18:42.150 --> 00:18:43.170
What?

00:18:43.550 --> 00:18:47.600
Uh, well, you know...

00:18:49.610 --> 00:18:51.240
I like you, Hosen!

00:18:51.820 --> 00:18:54.790
And, well...

00:18:54.790 --> 00:18:58.870
I guess it's weird to ask you not
to worry about it, but... uh...

00:19:00.240 --> 00:19:01.250
I'm sorry.

00:19:01.630 --> 00:19:03.080
Don't apologize.

00:19:04.250 --> 00:19:06.460
You're right. Sorry.

00:19:06.460 --> 00:19:08.000
There you go again.

00:19:18.440 --> 00:19:20.020
My friend...

00:19:20.020 --> 00:19:21.400
Your friend?

00:19:21.400 --> 00:19:27.590
She's interested in someone, but that
someone used to like someone else...

00:19:28.690 --> 00:19:36.920
And that other woman was interested
in that man for a long time, too.

00:19:37.340 --> 00:19:39.590
I just couldn't stand watching
those two any more.

00:19:39.920 --> 00:19:42.500
They should just make up their minds!

00:19:44.050 --> 00:19:46.400
Is that what your friend said?

00:19:46.700 --> 00:19:49.080
Yes, my friend.

00:19:49.080 --> 00:19:51.890
I see. That's quite a problem.

00:19:51.890 --> 00:19:54.200
It's nothing you need to worry about.

00:19:54.780 --> 00:19:56.490
Sure, but...

00:20:03.740 --> 00:20:05.380
I'm the one who's worried.

00:20:05.910 --> 00:20:09.620
You're the friend, aren't you?

00:20:13.710 --> 00:20:15.460
It's starting.

00:20:28.680 --> 00:20:30.040
What's that?

00:20:30.040 --> 00:20:32.440
A fortune. I got it earlier.

00:20:32.440 --> 00:20:33.940
Oh. What's it say?

00:20:34.310 --> 00:20:39.380
“Wait until the time is right.”

00:20:39.670 --> 00:20:41.210
Huh.

00:20:43.270 --> 00:20:46.560
I've waited long enough.

00:20:53.210 --> 00:20:56.130
Your wish will come true.

00:20:59.060 --> 00:21:01.070
It's not coming true at all.

00:23:11.110 --> 00:23:12.990
Lazuline is a mysterious color.

00:23:12.990 --> 00:23:16.140
Depending on the angle, it appears
to be a different color.

00:23:16.140 --> 00:23:17.720
Hey, Onii-chan...

00:23:17.720 --> 00:23:20.880
How does it feel to have a girl
confess her feelings for you?

00:23:20.880 --> 00:23:22.430
How does it feel?

00:23:22.430 --> 00:23:24.550
Do you like it or not? Which is it?

00:23:26.280 --> 00:23:28.470
Well, it's sort of good,
and it's sort of bad...

00:23:28.470 --> 00:23:29.400
Which is it?

00:23:29.400 --> 00:23:31.490
It's sort of bad, and it's sort of good...

00:23:31.490 --> 00:23:34.060
You're an indecisive lazuline man.

00:23:34.060 --> 00:23:36.850
Next episode, “Sentimental Lazuline.”

00:23:36.850 --> 00:23:39.370
Indecisiveness in love is generally taboo!
